arm64: dts: qcom: Add OnePlus 11 (salami) device tree

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Add the board DTS, compatible string and Makefile entry, including display, audio, input, RTC, debug log, eSIM and modem nodes, CPU cache descriptions, and the removal of the oem-vm-pre-region carveout overlapping trust_ui_vm_* regions.

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
